# Vercel Environment Variables
# Add these in your Vercel project settings

EMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASS=your-gmail-app-password

# Instructions:
# 1. Go to your Vercel project dashboard
# 2. Navigate to Settings → Environment Variables
# 3. Add EMAIL_USER with your Gmail address
# 4. Add EMAIL_PASS with your Gmail App Password
# 5. Redeploy your project
# 
# Note: Make sure 2-Factor Authentication is enabled on your Gmail account
# and you've generated an App Password at: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
